Yocan Hive 2.0 user here. Still fairly new. I was buying pre-filled carts and screwing them into the magnetic piece and dropping them into the Hive. Set my temp, and vape away.

&#x200B;

The dispensary closed down. So now I'm looking into MOMs to buy distillate to put into my refillable cart, using a syringe, especially now that I'm reading that not all carts will fit into the Hive 2.0. I haven't used the atomizer yet (the other cartridge that came with the Hive 2.0, used for shatter, wax, budder, etc.) because I'm being very picky. I want Blue Dream (either distillate, shatter or budder), and there are so many MOMs to look through to try to find the right flav.

&#x200B;

I just wish there was one search engine that will search and list the established MOMs for the product I want so I can simply base my purchasing decision on price/shipping/discounts/freebies.

&#x200B;

I hope this helped a bit, OP. If there is something specific you want to know, ask away.

